Mr. Thompson sat at his desk, staring blankly at the screen as he finished his last class before bedtime;  
It had been a grueling day, but now it was time for him to say goodbye to one more student.

The next morning, Mr. Thompson stepped outside into the bright sunlight, feeling refreshed yet exhausted from the past few hours spent teaching. He took a deep breath, ready to start his day anew.
